    <p style="color: var(--primary-blue); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;">
      Flutter Hotels & Resorts — Service Delivery & Reservation Confirmation Terms
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section-padding" style="background: #f8fafc;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; background: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;">
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">Last Updated: August 18, 2026 | Hospitality Service Delivery Policy</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Service Delivery Model</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      As a hotel and resort establishment, <strong>Flutter Hotels & Resorts</strong> provides hospitality accommodation and resort services rather than physical shipped goods. Therefore, "Delivery" constitutes the instant electronic confirmation of your stay reservation and the fulfillment of physical room services at our property upon check-in.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Instant Booking Confirmation</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      Upon successful payment authorization via our website or payment links, your booking confirmation voucher containing your unique Booking Reference ID, dates of stay, room type, and check-in instructions will be immediately displayed on screen and sent to your registered Email Address / WhatsApp number within <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Service Fulfillment & Check-in</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      Physical service delivery takes place at our resort property (Flutter Hotels & Resorts, Palkot–Lansdowne, Garhwal, Uttarakhand) starting on your scheduled Check-in date at 12:00 PM. Guests present their booking voucher and valid photo ID at the front desk to receive room key access.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Contact & Support</h2>
